+	help
+	  Enable this for TCON_TV1 of the Allwinner A733 (sun60iw2), the timing
+	  generator that feeds the DisplayPort transmitter. It programs a raster
+	  from a mode and can drive that raster from the TCON's own built-in
+	  pattern generator (VDBIST), which is what makes a picture provable on
